mstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345940/extras/2d2ad480fa10729ab589ad1ccc614602.mp4?t=1748025291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Unscramble <strong>over 900 anagrams</strong> across <strong>36 categories</strong> like science &amp; tech, vice &amp; virtue, countries, major cities, and so much more! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345940/extras/e4d494f2eea0b1c0e8f0af6969272f13.avif?t=1748025291\" /></div><br>For every 5 anagrams you solve, you earn a key! Use keys to unlock new word categories plus <strong>3 bonus game modes</strong> with <strong>500 new anagrams:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u><strong>ZEN MODE:</strong></u> solve <strong>endless anagrams</strong> with unlimited hints, or choose your favorite colors &amp; enjoy a breezy <strong>puzzle that never ends</strong> <br></li><li><u><strong>BLITZ MODE:</strong></u> race against the clock with <strong>only 60 seconds to solve each anagram</strong>, or put your matching skills to the test with <strong>only 10 seconds to find each match</strong>--but beware, the longer you play, the harder it gets!<br></li><li><u><strong>FREE MODE:</strong></u> love the hardest levels or just feel like solving easy anagrams? This is the mode for you! <strong>Choose your own difficulty</strong> and play <i>your</i> way</li></ul>",
